1894–95 was the seventh season of football for [[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]], who competed in the [[Scottish First Division]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.londonhearts.com/scores/a1890/celtic1895.htm|title=Results for Celtic for 1894-95|website=www.londonhearts.com}}</ref> They failed to win any major domestic honour after having won either the league or the Scottish Cup in the previous three seasons. However, they won both the [[Glasgow Cup]] and the [[Glasgow Charity Cup]].

